# Agent Episode Replay Ledger

> topic: <topic-id>
> schema: ndf-replay-ledger/v1
> store: .ndf/replay/ (gitignored local or controlled artifact store)

This ledger stores only small, reviewable pointers. Transcripts and large blobs MUST NOT be
copied into the binder.

| recorded_at | episode_id | task | manifest_sha | role_plan_sha | completion_commit | replay_coverage | artifact_location | note |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| <ISO-8601> | <ep-id> | <task> | <sha256> | <sha256> | <sha256> | R0; R1/R2 if available | <local/cold-store pointer> | <coverage gaps> |

## Rules

- The Episode tip and every referenced object MUST pass `ndf_replay.py fsck`.
- `completion_only`, `messages_only`, missing prompt surface, or recorded-only remote tools
  MUST remain explicit coverage gaps.
- A checkpoint appends a commit and preserves raw parent events.
- R3 forks are new history and MUST NOT be cited as reproduction of the original decision.
- Human gate tags require a valid gate receipt; Agent-created approval tags are forbidden.
